<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-CROATIA OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CROATIA OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>UMAG, Croatia 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results of the Croatia Open on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat 5-Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) 3-6 6-3 6-4 Alberto Martin (Spain) beat 4-Javier Sanchez (Spain) 3-6 6-4 6-1 2-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat 7-Albert Portas (Spain) 1-6 6-3 7-5 1-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat 8-Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) 6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
